Syntax: pray 'knit bone' <target>

The Knit Bone prayer channels divine healing energy to mend broken and
fractured bones, restoring them to their original state. The prayer causes
bone fragments to realign and fuse together, healing in moments what would
normally take weeks of rest and splinting.

The prayer specifically targets bone damage - it does not heal the soft
tissue injuries that typically accompany broken bones. Bleeding, bruising,
torn muscles, and nerve damage from the original injury remain and must
be addressed separately. For this reason, knit bone is often used in
combination with other healing prayers.

A successfully knit bone becomes as good as new, with no lingering weakness
or deformity. The prayer works on any broken bone regardless of severity,
from hairline fractures to compound breaks. However, it cannot regrow
bones that have been completely destroyed or lost.

The prayer requires the caster to specify which limb or body part to heal.

See Also: RESTORE LIMB, SALVE, CLOT, EXPEL
